# Chandra, Chill of Compliance's "-6: You get an emblem with 'Whenever you cast a spell, draw a card.'" Three +1s take
# her from 3 to 6 loyalty; on turn 7 the -6 leaves her at 0, so she is put into the graveyard (CR 704.5i), and the emblem
# stays in Bot1's command zone (CR 114.4). Bot1's Ancestral Recall then triggers it, the draw resolving first; Bot2's
# Ornithopter, cast by an opponent, does not.

